AudioMuse-AI performs local sonic analysis of a music library
(embeddings via musicnn/CLAP ONNX models) and generates smart
playlists for Navidrome and other Subsonic servers, without external
services. This package is the native CPU baseline: Flask UI plus
taskqueue workers over packaged Python dependencies; GPU acceleration
is provided by the podman/linuxulator worker (runbook 26 in the homelab
repo), not this package.

WWW: https://github.com/NeptuneHub/AudioMuse-AI
